51	/// How deep [`merge`] and [`lerp`] will walk a patch. The deepest real path
52	/// in the §5.2 schema is `video.shadow.color` — three levels — so 8 leaves
53	/// generous room while bounding the recursion, which is what keeps a
54	/// hand-written or generated patch from driving these routines down an
55	/// arbitrarily deep tree. (`serde_json` already caps parse nesting at 128;
56	/// this is the cheaper, local guarantee.)
57	pub(crate) const MAX_PATCH_DEPTH: u32 = 8;
