3	//! `actions.rs` has merged and interpolated it, using the same table
4	//! `props_check.rs` holds for a direct edit. The video and audio clamps
5	//! were a pure move out of `actions.rs` (issue batch B87, toll A);
6	//! `clamp_text` was added by #353.
